 selection into the three level scenes.","Choose one requirement to revise with an agent, then replay the relevant stage and check for regressions.","This author-published OpenGame case connects a detailed action-game prompt to a live result and its generated source. Assess the implementation against the brief instead of treating the prompt as proof that every feature works.",[513,514,515,516],{"_66":511,"_34":368,"_26":379},{"_66":507,"_34":491,"_26":117,"_107":508},{"_66":502,"_34":503,"_107":504,"_167":168},{"_66":367,"_34":368,"_107":499},[398,399,166],"example:opengame-tower-defense","opengame-tower-defense","Hajimi Defense: The Tuna Crisis","A cat-themed tower defense published with its original generation prompt, live browser build, and exact game project.","/examples/opengame-tower-defense/",{"_28":525,"_30":526,"_32":527,"_155":390,"_151":157,"_147":391,"_143":579,"_9":580,"_128":581,"_118":582,"_41":583,"_103":584,"_93":585},[531,532,533,534,535,536,537,538,539,540,541,542,543,544,545,546,547,548,549],{"_62":30,"_68":526,"_64":30,"_94":-7},{"_62":156,"_68":527,"_64":32,"_94":-7},{"_62":63,"_66":153,"_68":390,"_64":155,"_94":144},{"_62":63,"_66":149,"_68":150,"_64":151,"_94":152},{"_62":63,"_66":145,"_68":389,"_64":147,"_94":148},{"_62":63,"_66":141,"_68":579,"_64":143,"_94":144},{"_62":84,"_66":134,"_135":136,"_87":574,"_64":9,"_94":-7},{"_62":90,"_66":129,"_87":571,"_64":128,"_94":-7},{"_62":63,"_66":126,"_68":379,"_64":128,"_94":-7},{"_62":63,"_66":124,"_68":125,"_64":118,"_94":-7},{"_62":90,"_66":119,"_87":567,"_64":118,"_94":-7},{"_62":63,"_66":116,"_68":117,"_64":118,"_94":-7},{"_62":90,"_66":111,"_87":562,"_64":41,"_94":-7},{"_62":63,"_66":109,"_68":110,"_64":41,"_94":-7},{"_62":90,"_66":101,"_87":559,"_64":103,"_94":-7},{"_62":90,"_66":91,"_87":555,"_64":93,"_94":-7},{"_62":84,"_64":85,"_66":86,"_87":554},{"_62":70,"_64":71,"_66":550,"_73":551,"_75":552,"_41":553,"_78":79,"_80":81,"_82":83},{"_62":63,"_64":65,"_66":67,"_68":69},"The generated tower-