0},"https://github.com/simonw/raccoon-heist/","Game logic, procedural characters and audio, vendored Three.js, generated textures and title art, plus the session transcript. Serve the repository over HTTP; playing uses no generation API.",[632],{"_66":633,"_34":616,"_107":634},"Play Raccoon Heist","Press Start the Heist. Use WASD or arrows to move and Space to dash; mobile has a touch stick and Dash button. Collect loot automatically and return to the dumpster to bank it.",[636],{"_66":637,"_34":638,"_107":-7},"Read the creator’s full build walkthrough","https://simonwillison.net/2026/Aug/5/raccoon-heist/",[640,641,642,643],"Play a night and test movement, loot pickup, carrying limits, banking, and getting caught.","Read the creator’s walkthrough of the prompt, art generation, and GitHub Pages workflow.","Use the build notes to study the playable core, mobile rendering fixes, and guard-dog behavior.","Serve the full game locally and compare its code and assets with the documented decisions.","The creator publishes the prompt, Claude Code session, generated textures, and build notes. Claude implemented the game and tested it; the author reviews its strengths and gameplay limitations.","Asset creation tools",false,[649],"assetTools","gpt-image-2","Three.js · JavaScript",[649],[640,641,642,643],{"_66":637,"_34":638,"_26":169},{"_66":633,"_34":616,"_26":117,"_107":634},{"_66":296,"_34":629,"_167":168,"_107":630},{"_66":624,"_34":625,"_107":626},[323,324,166],"example:claude-agent-team-tetris","claude-agent-team-tetris","Tetris built by an AI agent team","A complete browser game with a published account of how three Claude Code teammates divided the rules, rendering, and controls.","/examples/claude-agent-team-tetris/",{"_28":659,"_30":660,"_32":661,"_155":716,"_151":157,"_147":158,"_143":715,"_9":717,"_128":718,"_118":719,"_41":720,"_103":721,"_93":722},[665,666,667,668,669,670,671,672,673,674,675,676,677,678,679,680,681,682,683],{"_62":30,"_68":660,"_64":30,"_94":-7},{